# Groovy sandbox allow-list.
#
# Every signature below must correspond to a member actually used by, or safely
# derivable from, the legitimate Groovy implementations shipped with Syncope.
# Reflection, script compilation/evaluation, process execution, filesystem and
# network access are deliberately absent; deployers can still override this file
# with deployment-specific needs via security.groovyWhitelist.

